    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now Differentiating both side&nbsp;w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>Let</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Which is a linear differential equation,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Now solution of the differential equation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Now given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the function will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, the required value is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
